{
  "id": "1SA.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 13",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli akalya engoma aina emyaka 30; kandi yatwara Isiraeli emyaka 42.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Isiraeli akarondamu abantu 3,000; omuli abo 2,000 yaikara nabo Mikimashi n'omu mabanga ga Betheli, kandi 1,000 baikara na Yonatani omuli Gibea eya Benjamini. Abasigaire bona yabashubya omuka omu mahema gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatani atera eboma y'Abafilisiti ababaire bali Gibea; Abafilisiti bakihulira. Shauli atera enzamba omu nsi yona nagamba ati, “Abaheburania bahulire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli yona ehulira okwo Shauli ateire eboma y'Abafilisiti, n'okwo Isiraeli ebaire kijunde aha Bafilisiti. Abantu bahuruzibwa kushanga Shauli Giligali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti baterana kurashanisa Isiraeli, baina amagali 30,000, ab'efarasi 6,000 n'abaisherukale abandi bangi nk'omushenye gw'omwegego gw'enyanja; bagenda basisira Mikimashi oburugaizoba bwa Betiaveni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli kababoine okwo bazangiranwa baturutuma. Embaga ebona okwo yabundwa, abantu besheleka omu mpako n'omu bina n'omu mabare n'omu nyanga n'omu maziba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi bashabuka ebyambu bya Yorudani, bagya Gadi na Gileadi. Shauli akaba akyali Giligali; abantu bona bamuhonderayo nibachundwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alindaho ebiro mushanju akanya ako Samweli yabaire amuraganisize. Kyonkai Samweli tiyaizire Giligali n'abantu bamusigaho benaganaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Shauli aragira ati, “Ndetera ekihongo ky'okwokibwa n'ekihongo ky'emilembe.” Atamba ekihongo ky'okwokibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayamazire ati kukitamba, Samweli aija. Shauli agenda kumuchwekera, amushura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli amubaza ati, “Eki wakoraki?” Shauli amushubamu ati, “Orwo mboine abantu nibansigaho nibenaganaga, naiwe okaburwa kwija omu biro ebyo wagambire, kandi n'Abafilisiti bateraniire Mikimashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngamba nti, ‘Abafilisiti nibaija kumbundira Giligali ntakashabire bujuni bwa Mukama;’ nyegimba mara ntamba ekihongo ky'okwokibwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli amugambira ati, “Wakora eky'obufera, tiwakwata muhango gwa Mukama Ruhanga wawe ogwo akuragiire. Kuba wamuhulira, obukama bwa Isiraeli yakubukuhaire na bijukuru bawe ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mbwenu obukama bwawe tibugendelere. Omukama yahigire omuntu ow'alikwenda, yamuronkire kuba mukama w'abantube, orwo otahikya kyo yakuragiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli aruga Giligali agya Gibea eya Benjamini. Na Shauli ahikanisa abantu nka rukaga abo yabaire ainabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aikara Gibea eya Benjamini, n'omutabani Yonatani n'abo yabaire ainabo. Abafilisiti basisira Mikimashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisherukale b'Abafilisiti batabara kunyaga omu mitwe eshatu; ogumoi gwolekera Ofura omu nsi ya Shuali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogundi gwolekera Betihoroni; ogwa kashatu gwolekera omu rubibi orulebire obusoka bw'Oruhanga rwa Zeboimu mukono gw'eirungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nsi yona ya Isiraeli tihakubonekiremu muhesi n'omoi, enshonga Abafilisiti bakabatanga kuhesha embanda n'amachumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bagyaga omu Bafilisiti kuba niyo bahyolera epulau zabo, n'enfuka, n'endyamiti, n'empabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuhyora epulau n'enfuka bashashuraga esarafu emoi enke, kandi aha ndyamiti n'emihunda bashashuraga esarafu ibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo aha kiro ky'endashana abantu abo Shauli na Yonatani babaire bainabo thaliho n'omoi yabaire akwete mbanda anga ichumu, shana Shauli na Yonatani omutabani bonkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma eihe ly'Abafilisiti liruga omu boma ligya omu nkiro za Mikimashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
